# Emacs transients
\#*\#
.#*

# boff-deployed output (dogfooding). Anchored to the repo root: a bare `.opencode/`
# also matches nested paths, which would swallow bundle content such as
# commons-dev/plugins/rtk-opencode/.opencode/plugins/rtk.js.
/.boff/
/.claude/
/.opencode/
/.agents/
/.config/
/.mcp.json
/opencode.json
/GEMINI.md
/.tldr/
/.tldrignore

# Python bytecode (hooks/*.py)
__pycache__/
*.py[codz]
